#: ../../source/templates_uber.md:16
msgid "1. Visual Theme & Atmosphere"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/templates_uber.md:18
msgid ""
"Uber's design language is a masterclass in confident minimalism -- a "
"black-and-white universe where every pixel serves a purpose and nothing "
"decorates without earning its place. The entire experience is built on a "
"stark duality: jet black (`#000000`) and pure white (`#ffffff`), with "
"virtually no mid-tone grays diluting the message. This isn't the sterile "
"minimalism of a startup that hasn't finished designing -- it's the "
"deliberate restraint of a brand so established it can afford to whisper."
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/templates_uber.md:20
msgid ""
"The signature typeface, UberMove, is a proprietary geometric sans-serif "
"with a distinctly square, engineered quality. Headlines in UberMove Bold "
"at 52px carry the weight of a billboard -- authoritative, direct, "
"unapologetic. The companion face UberMoveText handles body copy and "
"buttons with a slightly softer, more readable character at medium weight "
"(500). Together, they create a typographic system that feels like a "
"transit map: clear, efficient, built for scanning at speed."
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/templates_uber.md:22
msgid ""
"What makes Uber's design truly distinctive is its use of full-bleed "
"photography and illustration paired with pill-shaped interactive elements"
" (999px border-radius). Navigation chips, CTA buttons, and category "
"selectors all share this capsule shape, creating a tactile, thumb-"
"friendly interface language that's unmistakably Uber. The illustrations "
"-- warm, slightly stylized scenes of drivers, riders, and cityscapes -- "
"inject humanity into what could otherwise be a cold, monochrome system. "
"The site alternates between white content sections and a full-black "
"footer, with card-based layouts using the gentlest possible shadows "
"(rgba(0,0,0,0.12-0.16)) to create subtle lift without breaking the flat "
"aesthetic."
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/templates_uber.md:24
msgid "**Key Characteristics:**"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/templates_uber.md:25
msgid ""
"Pure black-and-white foundation with virtually no mid-tone grays in the "
"UI chrome"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/templates_uber.md:26
msgid ""
"UberMove (headlines) + UberMoveText (body/UI) -- proprietary geometric "
"sans-serif family"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/templates_uber.md:27
msgid ""
"Pill-shaped everything: buttons, chips, nav items all use 999px border-"
"radius"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/templates_uber.md:28
msgid "Warm, human illustrations contrasting the stark monochrome interface"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/templates_uber.md:29
msgid "Card-based layout with whisper-soft shadows (0.12-0.16 opacity)"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/templates_uber.md:30
msgid "8px spacing grid with compact, information-dense layouts"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/templates_uber.md:31
msgid "Bold photography integrated as full-bleed hero backgrounds"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/templates_uber.md:32
msgid "Black footer anchoring the page with a dark, high-contrast environment"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/templates_uber.md:34
msgid "2. Color Palette & Roles"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/templates_uber.md:36
msgid "Primary"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/templates_uber.md:37
msgid ""
"**Uber Black** (`#000000`): The defining brand color -- used for primary "
"buttons, headlines, navigation text, and the footer. Not \"near-black\" "
"or \"off-black,\" but true, uncompromising black."
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/templates_uber.md:38
msgid ""
"**Pure White** (`#ffffff`): The primary surface color and inverse text. "
"Used for page backgrounds, card surfaces, and text on black elements."
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/templates_uber.md:40
msgid "Interactive & Button States"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/templates_uber.md:41
msgid ""
"**Hover Gray** (`#e2e2e2`): White button hover state -- a clean, cool "
"light gray that provides clear feedback without warmth."
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/templates_uber.md:42
msgid ""
"**Hover Light** (`#f3f3f3`): Subtle hover for elevated white buttons -- "
"barely-there gray for gentle interaction feedback."
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/templates_uber.md:43
msgid ""
"**Chip Gray** (`#efefef`): Background for secondary/filter buttons and "
"navigation chips -- a neutral, ultra-light gray."
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/templates_uber.md:45
msgid "Text & Content"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/templates_uber.md:46
msgid ""
"**Body Gray** (`#4b4b4b`): Secondary text and footer links -- a true mid-"
"gray with no warm or cool bias."
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/templates_uber.md:47
msgid ""
"**Muted Gray** (`#afafaf`): Tertiary text, de-emphasized footer links, "
"and placeholder content."
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/templates_uber.md:49
msgid "Borders & Separation"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/templates_uber.md:50
msgid ""
"**Border Black** (`#000000`): Thin 1px borders for structural containment"
" -- used sparingly on dividers and form containers."
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/templates_uber.md:52
msgid "Shadows & Depth"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/templates_uber.md:53
msgid ""
"**Shadow Light** (`rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.12)`): Standard card elevation -- a "
"featherweight lift for content cards."
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/templates_uber.md:54
msgid ""
"**Shadow Medium** (`rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.16)`): Slightly stronger elevation "
"for floating action buttons and overlays."
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/templates_uber.md:55
msgid ""
"**Button Press** (`rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.08)`): Inset shadow for active/pressed"
" states on secondary buttons."
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/templates_uber.md:57
msgid "Link States"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/templates_uber.md:58
msgid ""
"**Default Link Blue** (`#0000ee`): Standard browser blue for text links "
"with underline -- used in body content."
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/templates_uber.md:59
msgid ""
"**Link White** (`#ffffff`): Links on dark surfaces -- used in footer and "
"dark sections."
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/templates_uber.md:60
msgid ""
"**Link Black** (`#000000`): Links on light surfaces with underline "
"decoration."
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/templates_uber.md:62
msgid "Gradient System"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/templates_uber.md:63
msgid ""
"Uber's design is **entirely gradient-free**. The black/white duality and "
"flat color blocks create all visual hierarchy. No gradients appear "
"anywhere in the system -- every surface is a solid color, every "
"transition is a hard edge or a shadow."
msgstr ""

